WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.051 --> 01:44.104
=Episode 14=

01:44.670 --> 01:46.750
Then my wish is

01:48.069 --> 01:48.949
for smooth sailing

01:50.229 --> 01:53.869
and a swift finish.

01:54.670 --> 01:55.509
Finish what?

01:59.149 --> 02:02.069
To finish destiny's arrangement,
of course.

02:07.309 --> 02:07.910
I'll drink.

02:12.469 --> 02:13.270
It's my turn.

02:17.629 --> 02:18.990
Spade, Mr. Gao.

02:23.589 --> 02:25.110
I... I'd better drink first.

02:25.110 --> 02:25.950
I have no wishes.

02:26.309 --> 02:27.390
- No.
- No.

02:27.390 --> 02:28.629
You must say one.

02:28.629 --> 02:29.830
Not following the rules?

02:30.029 --> 02:31.230
I just said mine.

02:31.230 --> 02:31.950
Exactly.

02:32.230 --> 02:33.709
Don't you want to find a girlfriend?

02:40.029 --> 02:41.230
What if I already have one?

02:42.029 --> 02:42.909
Who?

02:44.070 --> 02:45.670
You can only ask one question.

02:46.270 --> 02:47.230
I... I'll draw.

02:49.429 --> 02:50.110
Yours.

02:54.510 --> 02:55.149
I...

02:56.070 --> 02:57.909
I hope that in the future, I will

02:59.110 --> 03:00.830
be braver at work.

03:05.830 --> 03:06.790
And in love too.

03:09.110 --> 03:09.709
Wait a minute.

03:10.309 --> 03:12.429
Tiehan, you need to be more specific.

03:12.429 --> 03:13.429
How to be braver?

03:14.149 --> 03:15.709
For example,

03:15.709 --> 03:17.830
how to be braver with Mengmeng?

03:18.510 --> 03:20.830
Right? Pursue Mengmeng bravely?

03:21.550 --> 03:22.510
Stop.

03:24.350 --> 03:26.110
Tiehan, just be brave and be yourself.

03:26.110 --> 03:27.589
Do whatever you want.

03:30.230 --> 03:31.110
Mengmeng, your turn.

03:32.149 --> 03:33.110
Actually,

03:33.429 --> 03:36.189
I think I'm already doing great.

03:36.990 --> 03:38.350
I have my job

03:39.070 --> 03:40.070
and people I love.

03:44.830 --> 03:46.550
And most importantly, I have you all.

03:47.749 --> 03:49.869
Do you know that on this planet,

03:49.869 --> 03:51.510
the probability of two people meeting

03:51.510 --> 03:53.469
is only 0.00478?

03:54.070 --> 03:55.350
Such a tiny chance.

03:56.149 --> 03:57.990
But we gathered together.

03:58.550 --> 03:59.429
What fate is this?

03:59.429 --> 04:00.390
What fate?

04:00.749 --> 04:02.110
It... it really is fate.

04:03.390 --> 04:03.909
Let's drink.

04:03.909 --> 04:05.350
- Come on.
- Come on.

04:06.550 --> 04:07.550
You haven't drunk this.

04:08.469 --> 04:09.270
I'll drink two.

04:09.270 --> 04:10.990
Mix this in. Mix it.

04:15.230 --> 04:16.949
Mengmeng, want to sing something?

04:17.509 --> 04:18.350
Yeah, Mengmeng.

04:19.030 --> 04:20.949
I won't sing. Why should I sing?

04:21.309 --> 04:22.790
You sing so beautifully.

04:23.230 --> 04:24.590
I remember your high school dream

04:24.590 --> 04:25.910
was to debut as a singer.

04:26.230 --> 04:27.670
You even won a singing contest.

04:27.944 --> 04:28.629
Sing one.

04:28.629 --> 04:29.509
- No.
- Sing one.

04:29.629 --> 04:30.309
- No.
- Come on.

04:30.309 --> 04:31.710
- I won't sing.
- Sing one.

04:31.949 --> 04:32.790
I won't sing.

04:33.150 --> 04:34.110
I won't sing.

04:38.389 --> 04:38.949
Excuse me.

04:38.949 --> 04:39.949
Sorry to bother you.

04:40.550 --> 04:42.110
Could my friend sing a song?

04:42.309 --> 04:43.309
Of course. Welcome.

04:43.389 --> 04:44.629
Thank you.

04:44.710 --> 04:45.269
Hurry.

04:49.629 --> 04:52.509
This song, Liked You for So Long,
is for everyone.

04:57.083 --> 05:00.168
♪Why won't you look at me♪

05:00.936 --> 05:03.912
♪Why won't you say a word♪

05:04.648 --> 05:10.120
♪Why can't you see what's on my mind♪

05:11.720 --> 05:14.728
♪I don't wanna hide in the corner♪

05:15.528 --> 05:18.408
♪Or do a monologue♪

05:19.240 --> 05:23.016
♪I don't wanna watch you from afar♪

05:24.328 --> 05:27.400
♪Like a fool♪

05:29.160 --> 05:31.112
♪I wanna be by your side♪

05:31.112 --> 05:32.872
♪To lean on your shoulder♪

05:32.968 --> 05:35.432
♪To hold the summer breeze♪

05:35.432 --> 05:36.456
♪And take it all in♪

05:36.456 --> 05:38.280
♪The sunset is so tender♪

05:38.408 --> 05:42.056
♪Melting every afternoon I miss you♪

05:43.816 --> 05:45.544
♪I wanna take a walk with you♪

05:45.672 --> 05:47.368
♪I wanna hold your hand♪

05:47.368 --> 05:49.869
♪Waiting until one night♪

05:49.869 --> 05:50.790
Your girlfriend?

05:52.670 --> 05:53.590
No, a friend.

05:55.670 --> 05:56.790
Your friend

05:57.470 --> 05:59.069
has real potential to be a singer.

05:59.629 --> 06:00.150
Here.

06:00.936 --> 06:02.069
(Chen Yujie, music producer)
This is my card.

06:02.429 --> 06:03.189
Pass it to her.

06:05.110 --> 06:05.670
Okay.

06:07.069 --> 06:08.389
I'll wait for her call.

06:13.150 --> 06:14.309
Who was that just now?

06:15.790 --> 06:18.590
He said he's a music producer

06:18.869 --> 06:20.710
and told me to give this to Mengmeng.

06:20.990 --> 06:21.710
Not a scam, is it?

06:21.710 --> 06:23.150
(It's her career's turning point.)

06:23.309 --> 06:25.110
No, absolutely not a scam.

06:25.550 --> 06:27.110
You must give her this card.

06:28.110 --> 06:28.910
Don't worry.

06:29.710 --> 06:30.216
Okay.

06:30.856 --> 06:32.904
♪I wanna be by your side♪

06:32.904 --> 06:34.792
♪To lean on your shoulder♪

06:34.792 --> 06:37.384
♪To hold the summer breeze♪

06:37.384 --> 06:38.408
♪And take it all in♪

06:38.408 --> 06:40.168
♪The sunset is so tender♪

06:40.168 --> 06:43.752
♪Melting every afternoon I miss you♪

06:45.576 --> 06:47.272
♪I wanna take a walk with you♪

06:47.272 --> 06:49.256
♪I wanna hold your hand♪

06:49.256 --> 06:51.688
♪Waiting until one night♪

06:51.816 --> 06:52.808
♪Beneath a sky of stars♪

06:53.000 --> 06:54.536
♪I'll tell you loud and clear♪

06:54.664 --> 06:57.832
♪I've liked you for so long♪

07:00.136 --> 07:01.672
♪I wanna take a walk with you♪

07:02.389 --> 07:02.990
Tiehan.

07:03.749 --> 07:06.376
Mr. Gao works tomorrow
and must rise early. I'll take him home.

07:07.309 --> 07:08.269
Tell Mengmeng for me.

07:08.269 --> 07:08.872
Okay.

07:09.550 --> 07:10.790
Mr. Gao, let me take you home.

07:10.949 --> 07:11.710
It's too late.

07:20.949 --> 07:22.350
Thank you all.

07:23.069 --> 07:24.189
Not bad at all.

07:24.509 --> 07:25.389
Why did they leave?

07:26.670 --> 07:28.790
They said Mr. Gao
has something tomorrow.

07:28.910 --> 07:29.509
So they left.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.030
Let's go too, Silly Goose.

07:31.869 --> 07:32.509
Hold on.

07:32.949 --> 07:35.350
Mengmeng, this is for you.

07:35.350 --> 07:37.470
He said he's a music producer.

07:38.910 --> 07:40.150
Could it be a scam?

07:42.829 --> 07:43.710
Why are you laughing?

07:44.470 --> 07:47.309
Because your reaction
was exactly like mine.

07:47.949 --> 07:49.309
But Huan'er just said

07:49.309 --> 07:50.030
it's not a scam.

07:50.030 --> 07:50.629
Relax.

07:51.910 --> 07:53.269
Well, since she said so,

07:53.269 --> 07:54.230
it's definitely fine.

07:56.509 --> 07:58.269
Come with me to school again tomorrow.

07:59.550 --> 08:00.749
What for?

08:00.949 --> 08:02.470
Just say yes or no.

08:04.069 --> 08:04.648
Yes.

08:05.949 --> 08:06.990
Let's go. Take me home.

08:16.269 --> 08:17.269
Thanks for today.

08:19.150 --> 08:23.590
Before, because it involved
personal feelings,

08:24.670 --> 08:26.389
it wasn't convenient to explain.

08:27.509 --> 08:28.949
Hope you don't mind.

08:30.910 --> 08:31.949
I had my own motives too.

08:33.749 --> 08:34.350
What?

08:35.230 --> 08:36.509
I helped resolve your concerns.

08:36.830 --> 08:38.950
Now I can go all out to do some things.

08:42.350 --> 08:43.350
I meant work.

08:48.029 --> 08:50.310
65.3 percent, 66 percent...

08:52.749 --> 08:53.590
Why are you smiling?

08:55.269 --> 08:55.990
Nothing.

08:56.749 --> 08:59.310
I just learned a little secret.

09:00.029 --> 09:00.789
What secret?

09:02.190 --> 09:02.830
Secret.

09:22.590 --> 09:24.909
Not sure if it's because
I've been back more often lately,

09:25.509 --> 09:27.389
but I keep remembering things
from the past.

09:30.509 --> 09:31.269
Like what?

09:33.629 --> 09:34.590
Too many.

09:36.549 --> 09:37.590
Too many memories.

09:43.149 --> 09:43.869
Tiehan,

09:44.590 --> 09:46.070
do you remember back in college,

09:46.070 --> 09:47.029
when I came to you?

09:49.789 --> 09:50.830
I remember.

09:51.269 --> 09:53.110
Do you know why I came to you then?

10:00.909 --> 10:01.909
I'm sorry, Mengmeng.

10:02.230 --> 10:03.909
- I...
- Why are you apologizing?

10:04.869 --> 10:06.070
I should apologize.

10:07.590 --> 10:09.110
I only found out later

10:09.269 --> 10:11.549
that something happened
to your dad that day.

10:13.350 --> 10:14.710
I was too immature back then.

10:15.110 --> 10:16.029
Because of that,

10:16.029 --> 10:17.430
I had been mad at you for months,

10:17.430 --> 10:18.070
ignoring you.

10:18.470 --> 10:19.549
But at that time,

10:19.549 --> 10:20.590
you needed company most.

10:23.869 --> 10:25.350
Well...

10:25.350 --> 10:27.029
It was not your fault.

10:28.110 --> 10:28.669
It's okay.

10:29.470 --> 10:31.590
Do you know back then I wanted...

10:31.590 --> 10:32.669
At that time,

10:33.990 --> 10:35.590
we were both too young.

10:39.869 --> 10:42.350
Take Huan'er and Xiaojue's situation.

10:42.950 --> 10:45.430
We used to envy them so much.

10:45.669 --> 10:48.749
Being able to accompany
and support each other,

10:48.909 --> 10:49.749
they were so happy.

10:51.669 --> 10:53.590
But after all these years,

10:55.869 --> 10:57.110
everything has changed.

10:59.909 --> 11:00.669
I haven't changed.

11:42.470 --> 11:43.749
Why aren't you worried at all?

11:45.669 --> 11:46.509
Are you worried?

11:46.909 --> 11:48.990
No, I am just wondering

11:48.990 --> 11:50.789
why you parked so far away.

11:51.749 --> 11:52.830
Just to take a walk.

11:54.350 --> 11:55.629
Sometimes walking

11:55.869 --> 11:57.269
lets your mind go blank

11:57.749 --> 11:59.830
and gives you some breathing room.

12:02.590 --> 12:04.070
I used to like walking as well.

12:04.669 --> 12:06.269
Too bad that I got busy later

12:06.269 --> 12:07.190
and didn't have time.

12:10.350 --> 12:12.389
Then let's walk together from now on.

12:16.190 --> 12:16.830
Sure.

12:19.909 --> 12:20.830
Is this a chair?

12:22.230 --> 12:22.950
It's a seesaw.

12:23.230 --> 12:24.190
A seesaw?

12:27.830 --> 12:28.509
Take that side.

12:28.509 --> 12:29.149
Sit over there.

12:38.629 --> 12:41.470
No way. You're secretly pushing.

12:47.269 --> 12:48.149
No way.

12:49.950 --> 12:50.509
We...

12:50.509 --> 12:51.990
We weigh the same?

12:53.909 --> 12:55.190
Why am I so heavy?

12:59.830 --> 13:01.230
You're not sitting at the end?

13:01.950 --> 13:03.430
Go down. I want to go up.

13:26.830 --> 13:27.950
Sorry, I didn't mean to.

13:29.110 --> 13:30.070
It's... it's fine.

13:30.310 --> 13:31.590
You can go up now.

13:32.310 --> 13:33.710
Didn't you tell me to go down?

13:33.909 --> 13:36.350
Yes, but I want to go down now.

13:37.590 --> 13:38.310
G-Go ahead.

13:39.029 --> 13:39.629
Okay.

13:43.909 --> 13:45.950
I'm fine.
My arm strength is pretty good.

13:45.950 --> 13:46.632
Wait...

13:46.749 --> 13:47.909
See? I've come up.

13:48.950 --> 13:50.029
You can stand up.

13:59.669 --> 14:00.710
Why not say it earlier?

14:02.070 --> 14:02.909
I thought you knew.

14:06.190 --> 14:06.830
What the heck?

14:06.830 --> 14:07.710
It's not fun at all.

14:11.990 --> 14:12.509
Well...

14:13.629 --> 14:17.070
I... I have an appointment
with a distributor in Lvcheng.

14:17.230 --> 14:18.190
I'll go tomorrow.

14:18.470 --> 14:19.149
Will you join me?

14:20.269 --> 14:20.830
I will.

14:23.869 --> 14:24.749
Just the two of us?

14:26.230 --> 14:27.350
Yes, just the two of us.

14:29.869 --> 14:30.509
Well,

14:30.909 --> 14:32.549
why isn't Luo going?

14:33.629 --> 14:36.264
You've always managed Dr. Wei's matters.
You know better than Luo.

14:37.029 --> 14:37.669
That's true.

14:37.669 --> 14:39.070
Indeed, I know a bit more.

14:39.269 --> 14:41.110
If it's for work,

14:41.110 --> 14:42.070
then I agree.

14:43.389 --> 14:44.040
Okay.

14:45.869 --> 14:46.869
I'll go home for dinner.

14:47.830 --> 14:48.389
See you.

14:48.869 --> 14:49.389
See you.

14:57.310 --> 14:58.149
Where are you going?

14:58.869 --> 14:59.496
Going home.

15:00.029 --> 15:01.070
Are you going to my place?

15:01.990 --> 15:02.509
Sure.

15:07.029 --> 15:07.549
Come on.

15:13.110 --> 15:13.950
Huan'er.

15:21.749 --> 15:22.509
My colleague.

15:23.310 --> 15:24.549
Hello, I'm Gao Haiming,

15:24.549 --> 15:25.509
Lin Huan'er's colleague.

15:44.990 --> 15:47.950
Not bad. I'm quite pleased.

15:55.350 --> 15:55.909
Come out!

16:00.310 --> 16:00.968
Hello.

16:01.430 --> 16:02.110
Hello, sir.

16:08.149 --> 16:09.470
Then let's start eating.

16:09.590 --> 16:10.430
Wait a moment.

16:11.149 --> 16:11.830
Huan'er, get up.

16:14.669 --> 16:15.272
Move aside.

16:20.430 --> 16:20.950
Sit.

16:33.629 --> 16:34.470
Gao, come on.

16:34.950 --> 16:36.149
Eat the fish.

16:36.310 --> 16:36.909
Thank you, sir.

16:37.110 --> 16:38.110
The one from earlier.

16:39.029 --> 16:39.549
Okay.

16:40.190 --> 16:41.389
And there are ribs.

16:41.950 --> 16:43.070
Sweet and Sour Ribs.

16:43.430 --> 16:44.430
Huan'er and Le'er

16:44.710 --> 16:46.070
love this dish the most.

16:47.389 --> 16:48.710
Eat more while it's hot.

16:48.840 --> 16:49.549
It's enough.

16:49.549 --> 16:50.629
Eat more.

16:51.869 --> 16:52.389
Gao,

16:53.749 --> 16:55.909
I heard you also work at Letao, right?

16:56.008 --> 16:56.710
Yes.

17:01.590 --> 17:02.430
What position?

17:03.070 --> 17:03.950
- Department Manager.
- Department Supervisor.

17:05.470 --> 17:06.390
- Supervisor.
- Manager.

17:08.109 --> 17:09.509
I... I was a supervisor before.

17:09.670 --> 17:10.749
He'll soon be a manager.

17:10.749 --> 17:11.309
Yes.

17:12.829 --> 17:13.710
Good.

17:15.870 --> 17:17.430
The name Gao Haiming

17:17.630 --> 17:19.190
sounds so familiar.

17:22.630 --> 17:24.150
- In a magazine...
- You haven't seen it.

17:25.230 --> 17:25.789
Okay.

17:28.710 --> 17:30.470
Being the manager is good.

17:30.470 --> 17:31.430
A bright future ahead.

17:31.670 --> 17:32.269
Come on.

17:32.549 --> 17:33.749
Eat more ribs.

17:33.749 --> 17:34.390
It's enough.

17:34.630 --> 17:36.789
Being the manager is quite a dedication.

17:36.789 --> 17:37.910
Eat more ribs.

17:38.549 --> 17:39.990
Enough. Don't serve him more.

17:40.309 --> 17:41.589
I haven't eaten any yet.

17:41.990 --> 17:43.309
What's the rush?

17:43.309 --> 17:44.789
I can make it for you every day.

17:45.109 --> 17:46.950
Gao rarely comes, right?

17:47.150 --> 17:48.069
Eat more.

17:48.349 --> 17:49.000
Okay.

17:51.240 --> 17:51.829
Right!

17:53.710 --> 17:55.230
The rice. I forgot to serve the rice.

17:56.190 --> 17:56.710
Well...

17:56.710 --> 17:57.710
It's okay. No rush, sir.

18:10.910 --> 18:12.190
I haven't eaten any yet.

18:13.630 --> 18:15.950
Lin Le'er, I'll hit you.

18:18.950 --> 18:19.670
Take a piece.

18:34.549 --> 18:35.670
Try this. This is delicious.

18:54.509 --> 18:55.470
Say it.

18:59.870 --> 19:01.670
Dad, how about we...

19:01.670 --> 19:02.470
Play mahjong?

19:02.470 --> 19:04.109
Sure. It's been a while since I played.

19:05.190 --> 19:05.870
Mahjong?

19:05.870 --> 19:06.710
I don't know how.

19:07.390 --> 19:07.950
Eight of Dots.

19:08.509 --> 19:09.150
Wait.

19:09.704 --> 19:10.349
Kong.

19:11.190 --> 19:11.749
Kong?

19:12.990 --> 19:13.549
East Wind.

19:13.630 --> 19:14.789
East Wind? Kong.

19:14.789 --> 19:15.670
You kong too?

19:15.950 --> 19:17.549
What are you doing? Let me take my turn.

19:18.390 --> 19:18.990
Red Dragon.

19:18.990 --> 19:19.910
I haven't drawn a tile.

19:19.910 --> 19:20.670
Hurry up.

19:20.910 --> 19:21.470
One of Dots.

19:21.910 --> 19:23.190
- Two of Characters.
- Two of Characters?

19:23.190 --> 19:24.430
Two of Characters? I win!

19:25.430 --> 19:26.029
You win?

19:26.390 --> 19:27.269
I win too.

19:28.069 --> 19:28.749
You too?

19:30.549 --> 19:31.069
Come on.

19:32.069 --> 19:32.712
Food rewards.

19:33.390 --> 19:34.029
And gold coins.

19:34.309 --> 19:35.509
So much. How big was that win?

19:35.749 --> 19:36.630
Let's keep going.

19:48.749 --> 19:51.549
Were you offering them tiles
on purpose today

19:51.549 --> 19:52.509
just to make them happy?

19:53.509 --> 19:54.870
We play for fun, right?

19:55.309 --> 19:56.589
Winning isn't everything.

19:58.710 --> 19:59.910
I never expected

20:00.150 --> 20:02.109
you'd actually know how to play mahjong.

20:04.549 --> 20:06.470
My grandma taught me when I was little.

20:06.829 --> 20:07.990
I haven't touched it since.

20:11.309 --> 20:11.950
Well?

20:12.589 --> 20:13.589
How's our cooking?

20:13.589 --> 20:15.150
Not as good as yours, huh?

20:19.349 --> 20:20.269
Want the truth?

20:20.630 --> 20:21.390
Go ahead.

20:24.630 --> 20:26.109
I think your family's is better.

20:27.749 --> 20:29.309
One particular dish

20:29.309 --> 20:30.509
must've won you over.

20:31.029 --> 20:32.230
Sweet and Sour Ribs? The fish?

20:33.069 --> 20:33.829
Neither.

20:34.749 --> 20:36.589
It's because you have an amazing family.

20:37.870 --> 20:38.829
For me,

20:39.230 --> 20:41.109
having the whole family sitting together

20:41.710 --> 20:43.029
to enjoy a meal happily

20:43.710 --> 20:44.749
is the greatest happiness.

20:48.990 --> 20:50.509
Actually, when I first arrived,

20:51.349 --> 20:52.829
I didn't get along with them well.

20:53.710 --> 20:55.749
But now I agree with you.

20:56.349 --> 20:58.109
They are indeed
wonderful family members.

20:58.910 --> 21:00.269
What do you mean by that?

21:02.430 --> 21:02.990
First...

21:04.589 --> 21:05.789
I first arrived in this world.

21:06.430 --> 21:08.829
Childhood is when we all
arrive in this world.

21:08.829 --> 21:09.390
Right?

21:11.309 --> 21:13.349
Teach me mahjong when you're free.

21:13.670 --> 21:14.710
Then I can join Mengmeng

21:14.710 --> 21:16.029
and Tiehan to win your money.

21:16.390 --> 21:16.990
Okay.

21:17.190 --> 21:17.749
Then

21:18.390 --> 21:20.230
I'll deduct teaching fees
from your salary.

21:21.230 --> 21:23.509
M-My salary won't cover that, will it?

21:25.990 --> 21:26.870
Thanks for today.

21:27.150 --> 21:27.990
I had a great time.

21:28.670 --> 21:29.549
Me too.

21:32.230 --> 21:33.710
Get some rest now.

21:38.390 --> 21:38.950
By the way,

21:39.829 --> 21:41.430
you said Le'er was transferring schools.

21:41.910 --> 21:43.309
Let me know if you need help.

21:45.789 --> 21:48.029
This won't come out of my salary, right?

21:49.230 --> 21:49.749
Good night.

21:50.190 --> 21:50.710
Good night.

22:07.549 --> 22:08.269
Congratulations.

22:08.509 --> 22:09.710
Male lead's fondness

22:09.710 --> 22:11.430
toward you has increased to 68 percent.

22:11.670 --> 22:13.069
68 percent?

22:14.230 --> 22:15.670
I can go back soon then.

22:23.749 --> 22:25.150
Nothing wrong with going back soon.

22:25.150 --> 22:25.829
Right?

22:26.749 --> 22:27.630
Keep pushing.

22:29.029 --> 22:29.910
Lvcheng.

22:30.990 --> 22:32.950
I'll need a solid plan.

22:39.549 --> 22:42.910
Flower shop has to be 2 PM to 3 PM.

22:43.509 --> 22:44.789
Peacock Lake...

22:46.990 --> 22:49.309
Peacock Lake closes at 4:30 PM.

22:49.309 --> 22:50.870
Huan'er, you have a job now.

22:50.870 --> 22:52.230
Why do you still do homework?

22:52.470 --> 22:53.269
You know nothing.

22:53.269 --> 22:54.309
I'm planning the trip.

22:55.150 --> 22:56.670
Planning? To take down which one?

22:56.670 --> 22:58.749
To take down Haiming?

23:00.069 --> 23:01.430
Lin Le'er, what's going on

23:01.430 --> 23:02.470
in your head?

23:02.630 --> 23:05.349
I suspect you're crushing on someone.

23:06.589 --> 23:07.630
Don't worry.

23:07.910 --> 23:09.870
With you as my cautionary tale,

23:10.190 --> 23:11.950
I'll never make your mistakes.

23:13.749 --> 23:14.950
I made a good cautionary tale.

23:15.630 --> 23:16.470
Huan'er, listen.

23:16.829 --> 23:18.950
Your taste in men was really bad before.

23:19.710 --> 23:21.990
Ou Xiaojue came to see me
just a couple of days ago.

23:22.470 --> 23:24.670
He did? What did he want?

23:25.109 --> 23:27.430
He asked me
to set up a meeting with you.

23:27.870 --> 23:30.109
He asked me to meet him
at a park south of the city.

23:30.670 --> 23:32.390
He seemed a bit off.

23:32.390 --> 23:33.470
So I ran away quickly.

23:35.470 --> 23:36.470
You did the right thing.

23:36.829 --> 23:37.950
With someone like him,

23:37.950 --> 23:39.390
you have to stay vigilant.

23:39.990 --> 23:41.349
If he goes to you again,

23:41.789 --> 23:42.950
come find me immediately.

23:42.950 --> 23:43.549
Understand?

23:45.309 --> 23:45.870
Okay?

23:45.990 --> 23:46.630
Okay.

23:46.829 --> 23:47.430
Okay.

23:50.509 --> 23:51.029
Huan'er,

23:51.190 --> 23:51.950
to be honest,

23:52.309 --> 23:53.749
I think Haiming is really

23:53.749 --> 23:54.990
a very, very good person.

23:55.269 --> 23:56.950
You have to hold on to him tight.

23:57.910 --> 23:59.950
The way you talk sounds a bit like Dad.

24:00.069 --> 24:02.109
I mean it. If you're with him,

24:02.109 --> 24:03.349
you'll definitely be happy.

24:07.230 --> 24:07.829
Le'er,

24:08.829 --> 24:09.870
I'll give your suggestion

24:10.670 --> 24:11.829
serious thought.

24:13.390 --> 24:15.069
You must think about it.

24:16.150 --> 24:16.710
I got it.

24:19.611 --> 24:21.192
(Yunsheng Tower)

24:22.870 --> 24:23.910
Mr. Gao, please sit.

24:23.910 --> 24:24.584
(Inclusion of Letao products in Huineng)
Thanks.

24:42.349 --> 24:44.109
Inclusion of Letao products in Huineng.

24:44.630 --> 24:45.309
Next,

24:45.670 --> 24:46.789
I will elaborate

24:46.789 --> 24:47.670
on market share,

24:47.670 --> 24:48.589
brand awareness,

24:48.589 --> 24:49.630
and our sales channels.

24:49.710 --> 24:51.870
These three points
are our most important core.

24:52.630 --> 24:53.349
Product line,

24:53.349 --> 24:54.029
process,

24:54.029 --> 24:54.870
sales channels,

24:55.150 --> 24:55.950
and market demand.

24:55.950 --> 24:58.470
Demand for feminine hygiene products
keeps growing.

25:27.549 --> 25:29.630
Boss, which company
are we going to next?

25:30.470 --> 25:37.390
We still have 48 hours to enjoy Lvcheng.

25:41.069 --> 25:41.870
What do you mean?

25:42.630 --> 25:43.190
Sorry.

25:43.789 --> 25:45.710
I thought
we could finish the work earlier.

25:47.230 --> 25:49.029
I didn't expect the schedule
to be so packed.

25:50.230 --> 25:51.589
So I extended the business trip

25:52.069 --> 25:52.990
by two days.

25:54.109 --> 25:55.390
If you can use

25:55.390 --> 25:56.589
the 48 hours well,

25:56.870 --> 25:58.309
the plans can surely be completed.

26:36.589 --> 26:37.190
Where is it?

26:37.829 --> 26:38.789
Where is it?

26:39.931 --> 26:41.512
(No. 24, Old Street, Hanling)

26:49.340 --> 26:50.990
(Forget Me)
We're here. This is the place.

26:51.803 --> 26:53.608
(Surrounded by Flowers, Lost in Dreams)

26:54.470 --> 26:55.109
I want to go.

26:57.589 --> 26:58.150
Okay.

27:03.829 --> 27:05.190
It's so beautiful in here.

27:05.390 --> 27:06.109
Welcome.

27:06.230 --> 27:08.230
Would you like to plant flowers
or buy flowers?

27:08.509 --> 27:10.349
We offer storage and maintenance too.

27:10.349 --> 27:11.470
So the flowers you plant

27:11.470 --> 27:13.430
can grow strong, just like your love.

27:13.910 --> 27:14.589
Customers have

27:14.589 --> 27:15.870
always planted flowers here.

27:16.390 --> 27:17.549
Well, actually we're not...

27:17.549 --> 27:20.150
So we can't plant flowers together
if we're not a couple?

27:20.910 --> 27:21.950
You still can.

27:22.309 --> 27:25.269
But if you're a couple
and come together next time,

27:25.269 --> 27:26.150
we'll have

27:26.150 --> 27:27.309
an extra gift for you.

27:28.749 --> 27:29.549
We are a couple.

27:32.150 --> 27:32.670
Yes.

27:35.910 --> 27:37.190
With so many beautiful flowers,

27:37.190 --> 27:38.950
why choose sunflowers?

27:40.430 --> 27:42.950
Other couples
would definitely choose roses.

27:46.950 --> 27:48.269
Well, I mean,

27:49.309 --> 27:51.109
roses are clearly more beautiful.

27:52.230 --> 27:53.109
But I think

27:53.230 --> 27:54.910
sunflower symbolism is more interesting.

27:56.670 --> 27:57.230
What is it?

27:59.509 --> 28:00.296
I'll browse first.

28:05.896 --> 28:09.470
To browse first? What does it mean?

28:15.803 --> 28:23.016
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

28:23.400 --> 28:31.080
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

28:31.624 --> 28:39.080
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

28:39.368 --> 28:43.848
♪Streaking across the sky♪

28:44.872 --> 28:54.504
♪Just to hold you♪

29:04.668 --> 29:06.824
(Forget Me)

29:07.069 --> 29:08.269
Hurry, only one minute's left.

29:09.029 --> 29:10.230
Hello, two people.

29:10.870 --> 29:12.190
Hello, two people.

29:14.749 --> 29:15.630
Hello.

29:16.168 --> 29:16.904
Hello.

29:17.029 --> 29:17.749
We're closed.

29:20.456 --> 29:21.000
(Ticket Office)

29:21.000 --> 29:22.109
We missed it by a minute.

29:22.910 --> 29:24.269
We should've come earlier.

29:24.910 --> 29:26.509
Darn it, such a good opportunity.

29:27.269 --> 29:29.029
They say if two people
come here together,

29:29.630 --> 29:30.829
they will be together forever.

29:31.309 --> 29:31.990
Hinting at me?

29:33.190 --> 29:34.029
No, not really.

29:34.710 --> 29:36.309
I just think this place

29:36.309 --> 29:37.390
is worth seeing.

29:37.390 --> 29:38.549
It'd be a pity not to visit.

29:39.109 --> 29:40.430
It's fine. We can come next time.

29:40.630 --> 29:41.749
There won't be a next time.

29:41.990 --> 29:43.910
Do you think it's easy to take a trip?

29:46.280 --> 29:46.829
Look.

29:46.829 --> 29:47.589
Look at what?

29:48.150 --> 29:48.990
Look at these trees.

29:49.829 --> 29:51.309
No one would see them as scenery.

29:51.990 --> 29:53.349
Even when we first arrived,

29:53.710 --> 29:54.870
we didn't notice them either.

29:55.589 --> 29:57.230
But they're still full of life.

29:59.589 --> 30:00.269
So?

30:00.589 --> 30:02.430
We came all this way
just to look at trees?

30:02.430 --> 30:03.190
They're everywhere.

30:03.190 --> 30:04.190
Like downstairs at home.

30:04.670 --> 30:06.190
But each one is different.

30:09.950 --> 30:11.269
No matter where you go,

30:11.509 --> 30:13.029
you won't see these trees again.

30:14.470 --> 30:15.509
You mean,

30:16.150 --> 30:18.749
no two leaves in this world
are identical, right?

30:19.990 --> 30:20.870
Gao Haiming,

30:21.069 --> 30:22.509
so you're a philosopher.

30:24.470 --> 30:26.190
Alright.
I want a picture with this tree.

30:26.950 --> 30:27.464
Okay.

30:34.230 --> 30:34.749
Come on.

30:36.670 --> 30:39.589
Three, two, one.

30:42.589 --> 30:43.230
Your turn.

30:43.390 --> 30:43.944
Okay.

31:45.069 --> 31:45.870
You're right.

31:47.029 --> 31:48.549
The scenery here is beautiful too.

31:49.749 --> 31:51.069
But the inside must be better.

31:51.069 --> 31:53.190
I just didn't plan well enough today.

31:53.190 --> 31:54.470
If I'd been more thorough,

31:54.470 --> 31:55.789
we could have gone inside.

31:56.470 --> 31:57.109
You

31:57.349 --> 31:59.549
are just too fixated
on reaching a destination

32:00.109 --> 32:01.470
and miss the views along the way.

32:01.950 --> 32:03.309
Isn't that an even bigger shame?

32:03.710 --> 32:05.269
You always seem so emotionally stable.

32:05.630 --> 32:06.789
It's not that I'm stable.

32:06.910 --> 32:07.910
You're always in a hurry.

32:09.910 --> 32:11.710
You're in a hurry to find a place,

32:11.710 --> 32:13.109
to solve a problem,

32:13.430 --> 32:14.749
and to finish a task.

32:15.190 --> 32:16.309
Why are you in such a rush?

32:17.190 --> 32:18.870
Am I? Am I really in a hurry?

32:19.150 --> 32:19.789
Yeah.

32:20.950 --> 32:22.029
Sometimes, wasting time

32:22.029 --> 32:23.069
can be a kind of joy too.

32:23.630 --> 32:24.230
Try it.

32:27.029 --> 32:28.509
Wasting time.

32:30.430 --> 32:31.190
Yeah.

32:33.150 --> 32:34.309
You make a good point.

32:36.950 --> 32:37.990
Then let's go fishing.

32:41.470 --> 32:41.990
Fishing?

32:42.109 --> 32:42.630
Yeah.

32:42.630 --> 32:43.430
Fishing is the best

32:43.430 --> 32:44.470
time-wasting activity.

32:46.029 --> 32:47.150
Fi...fishing? Forget it.

32:47.150 --> 32:47.749
Up ahead...

32:47.749 --> 32:48.710
There's a lake up ahead.

32:48.710 --> 32:49.509
We can fish there.

32:50.230 --> 32:51.069
Since we're here,

32:51.069 --> 32:52.309
let's go fishing today.

32:53.029 --> 32:54.589
We might not catch anything, right?

32:56.990 --> 32:59.789
Didn't you say
the result doesn't matter,

33:00.029 --> 33:01.749
but the views along the way do?

33:03.109 --> 33:03.749
Good.

33:04.430 --> 33:05.150
Fishing is good.

33:05.789 --> 33:07.549
Let's go fishing. To catch a big fish.

33:10.589 --> 33:11.749
We'll eat fish tonight.

33:13.150 --> 33:14.029
Very good.

33:19.109 --> 33:19.710
Come here.

33:22.230 --> 33:23.109
I just remembered.

33:24.190 --> 33:25.269
You're afraid of the sea.

33:28.029 --> 33:29.230
But this is a lake.

33:29.990 --> 33:30.870
Are you afraid too?

33:31.430 --> 33:32.789
What's scary about this lake?

33:32.789 --> 33:33.749
Look, it's very shallow.

33:34.029 --> 33:35.710
The water is waist-deep at most.

33:36.309 --> 33:38.910
Don't you think
what's under the water is scary?

33:39.309 --> 33:40.470
It seems calm on the surface.

33:40.990 --> 33:42.190
You never know what's there.

33:45.549 --> 33:46.309
Is it scary?

33:47.069 --> 33:48.509
Could there be a monster in there?

33:50.789 --> 33:51.336
Got one.

33:57.509 --> 33:58.190
There really is.

33:59.549 --> 34:00.390
It is scary.

34:00.390 --> 34:00.968
Really.

34:01.309 --> 34:02.069
Look.

34:02.150 --> 34:04.589
There are tiny fish in the water.

34:07.990 --> 34:08.830
It seriously hurts

34:08.830 --> 34:10.270
my enthusiasm and self-esteem.

34:10.270 --> 34:11.149
This is scary.

34:13.790 --> 34:15.189
Maybe I'm overthinking it.

34:17.310 --> 34:18.069
Don't overthink.

34:18.470 --> 34:20.549
This tiny fish must've been
overthinking just now

34:20.549 --> 34:22.029
and got caught before knowing it.

34:22.189 --> 34:23.069
It's not grown yet.

34:23.069 --> 34:24.029
How about we release it?

34:24.549 --> 34:25.430
I will.

34:25.990 --> 34:27.189
But not now.

34:27.709 --> 34:28.430
You know?

34:29.149 --> 34:30.149
If we release it now,

34:30.470 --> 34:32.069
this tiny fish will spill the beans

34:32.069 --> 34:33.189
and tell the other fish.

34:33.350 --> 34:35.109
Then we won't catch anything today.

34:35.109 --> 34:36.790
Going home empty-handed is scarier.

34:38.109 --> 34:40.669
So, we need to wait
until we catch a big one

34:40.669 --> 34:42.029
before releasing the small ones.

34:42.390 --> 34:44.310
Are you that sure we'll catch a big one?

34:44.589 --> 34:45.270
Absolutely.

34:45.830 --> 34:47.270
Today, I must treat you

34:47.270 --> 34:49.310
to a full banquet of fish I caught.

34:51.069 --> 34:51.688
Hurry.

34:55.430 --> 34:56.310
Come on.

35:24.029 --> 35:25.149
Bring me the big one.

35:25.149 --> 35:26.270
We will catch a big one.

36:16.072 --> 36:19.055
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:20.264 --> 36:23.035
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:24.936 --> 36:30.849
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:32.646 --> 36:35.706
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:36.872 --> 36:40.324
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:41.320 --> 36:46.846
♪Until the world's end♪

36:49.256 --> 36:53.052
♪If I could♪

36:53.640 --> 36:56.456
♪Keep loving you♪

36:57.480 --> 36:59.880
♪Hearing two hearts♪

36:59.880 --> 37:04.796
♪Beating together♪

37:05.768 --> 37:09.632
♪If I could♪

37:09.632 --> 37:12.872
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:13.928 --> 37:21.253
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

37:22.312 --> 37:25.256
♪Entwined worries linger♪

37:26.504 --> 37:29.256
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

37:31.112 --> 37:36.892
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

37:38.824 --> 37:41.849
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

37:43.094 --> 37:46.760
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

37:47.528 --> 37:53.375
♪Until the world's end♪

37:55.368 --> 37:59.272
♪If I could♪

37:59.880 --> 38:02.632
♪Keep loving you♪

38:03.688 --> 38:06.024
♪Hearing two hearts♪

38:06.024 --> 38:10.984
♪Beating together♪

38:11.976 --> 38:15.539
♪If I could♪

38:15.539 --> 38:19.240
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

38:20.232 --> 38:27.464
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪
